      "en": "Yet can we not now approach this ontological exigence directly and attempt to define its boundaries? In reality this is possible, I fear, only up to a certain point. For deep reasons that will appear gradually, I suspect that this exigence presents the singular character of being unable to become completely transparent to itself."
